---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Loan Rates & Fees" description="Understand the range of APRs, fees, and total costs associated with loans available through our network.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <article class="glass-card p-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Loan Rates &amp; Fees</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Last Updated: March 1, 2025</p>

      <p>The following information is provided to help you understand the potential cost of a personal loan obtained through our lender network. Actual rates and fees are determined solely by the lender and will be disclosed to you before you accept any offer.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Annual Percentage Rate (APR)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Range:</strong> 5.99% – 35.99% APR</li>
        <li>APR includes the interest rate plus any lender fees expressed as a yearly rate.</li>
        <li>Your actual APR depends on your credit score, income, loan amount, term, and lender-specific criteria.</li>
        <li>Short-term or small-dollar loans may carry higher effective APRs.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Loan Amounts &amp; Terms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Loan amounts:</strong> $100 – $50,000</li>
        <li><strong>Repayment terms:</strong> 61 days – 72 months</li>
        <li>Not all loan amounts or terms are available from all lenders or in all states.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Common Fees</h2>
      <p>Fees vary by lender. You may encounter:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Origination fee:</strong> 0% – 8% of the loan amount (some lenders charge none).</li>
        <li><strong>Late payment fee:</strong> Varies by lender and state law.</li>
        <li><strong>Prepayment penalty:</strong> Most personal loans have no prepayment penalty, but confirm with your lender.</li>
        <li><strong>Returned payment fee:</strong> May apply if a payment is returned due to insufficient funds.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Representative Cost Example</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 my-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-slate-800 text-white">
              <th class="py-2.5 px-4 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Borrowed</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-4 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">APR</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-4 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Term</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-4 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Monthly</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-4 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Total</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">$1,000</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4">15%</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4">12 mo</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-orange-600">$90.26</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">$1,083.10</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100">
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">$2,500</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4">15%</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4">24 mo</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-orange-600">$121.24</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">$2,909.76</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">$5,000</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4">15%</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4">48 mo</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-orange-600">$139.15</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">$6,679.20</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>These are illustrative examples only. Your actual costs will differ.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Our Service Fee</h2>
      <p>SecureLoan does <strong>not</strong> charge you any fee for using our matching service. We are compensated by lenders when a connection is made. See our <a href="/loan-disclosure" class="text-orange-600 underline">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>SecureLoan</strong><br/>
      123 Financial District Ave, Suite 400, New York, NY 10005<br/>
      Email: compliance@secureloan.example.com</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
